=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {p:Yoran-Oran (A)} at (G-10) in {z:Abyssea - Attohwa} at the base camp.
** __Optional:__ Speak to {p:Jakaka (A)} in Abyssea - Attohwa (I-10) for further information on the quest.
* Go to the small grass area in the south-east part of (I-10) by the bones. Veridical Conflux #03 is nearby, but you may need to wait for smoke to stop at (J-9) to get through. You may be better off just running to the location from the base camp.
* In the grass, move around and use the /clap emote until a glowing **Rockhopper** targetable location appears on the ground. Interact with it to get a {@k} {k:Rockhopper}.
* Speak to {p:Yoran-Oran (A)} to receive {@k} {k:Phial of counteragent}.
* Examine the **Gasponia** targetable flowers in the vicinity of (F-8)/(F-9). Veridical Conflux #00 is nearby.
* Speak to {p:Yoran-Oran (A)} to receive your reward.

=3 Augments
